HT-Demucs 6s separation model (downloaded on first use, not included in the installer)
Source code and pretrained weights: Meta AI Research, https://github.com/facebookresearch/demucs
ONNX export: StemSplitio/htdemucs-6s-onnx on Hugging Face (MIT, revision 49df9b6989cf2150840ea65b0bef77a2e471b678)

